      en: ["The stadium was originally opened in 1914 as Stade de Baduel.", "The official renaming to Stade Georges-Chaumet took place in 2014.", "The pitch is equipped with the latest generation of artificial turf.", "The facility also features an eight-lane athletics track.", "The seating capacity for football matches is exactly 7,000.", "It is located on Route de Baduel in the northeastern part of Cayenne."],
